## Build output
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
TestResults/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

## Sonar scanner working directory, created by `dotnet sonarscanner begin`.
.sonarqube/

## Agent transcripts: they contain prompts, tool output and file contents, and they are per-machine.
.sharpcoreagent/

## Local credentials. The product reads keys from the environment or from a file named by
## `--credential-file` / SHARPCOREAGENT_CREDENTIAL_FILE; these patterns keep either out of the repository.
*.env
.env
secrets.json
appsettings.Local.json
